WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:30.958
<b>Here,</b>

2
00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:33.750
<b>Lord Krishna is talking about those people</b>

3
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:38.250
<b>who only outwardly show control of the senses, </b>

4
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.375
<b>but</b>

5
00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:42.833
<b>whose mind is still impure.</b>

6
00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:44.375
<b>Lord Krishna says</b>

7
00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:48.541
<b>that a person who only displays external control,</b>

8
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:51.791
<b>but internally harbors desires,</b>

9
00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:54.541
<b>such a person is a hypocrite.</b>

10
00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.083
<b>Krishna is explaining here</b>

11
00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:03.333
<b>that if the mind itself is not pure,</b>

12
00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:06.416
<b>then mere external control is futile,</b>

13
00:01:06.416 --> 00:01:08.375
<b>it is just a show.</b>

14
00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:14.208
<b>If such a person thinks that he is </b>
<b>advancing on the path of spirituality,</b>

15
00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:17.291
<b>then he is not only lying to himself,</b>

16
00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:21.333
<b>but it is also hypocrisy with others.</b>

17
00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:24.458
<b>Spiritual upliftment is a far cry,</b>

18
00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:28.708
<b>such a person is rather degrading his level.</b>

19
00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:31.791
<b>For example, think for yourself</b>

20
00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:36.958
<b>- a person who shows the world </b>
<b>that he has renounced anger,</b>

21
00:01:36.958 --> 00:01:39.000
<b>has renounced lust.</b>

22
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.125
<b>He does not show outward anger</b>

23
00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:45.583
<b>but internally makes plans to harm others,</b>

24
00:01:45.583 --> 00:01:48.875
<b>and is also internally engaged in lust,</b>

25
00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:50.750
<b>harbors corrupt thoughts.</b>

26
00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.750
<b>What a great hypocrisy this is.</b>

27
00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.041
<b>If greed and attachments </b>
<b>remain alive in the mind,</b>

28
00:01:56.041 --> 00:02:00.250
<b>then the time is not far when, </b>
<b>as soon as others' eyes are averted,</b>

29
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:04.375
<b>this person will again be </b>
<b>absorbed in his attachments.</b>

30
00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:06.125
<b>This is not spiritual upliftment,</b>

31
00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:10.083
<b>this is falling to the lowest level.</b>

32
00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:12.125
<b>And because of such hypocrites,</b>

33
00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:14.958
<b>the faith of others is destroyed,</b>

34
00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:17.833
<b>their trust is broken.</b>

35
00:02:22.625 --> 00:02:26.083
<b>For any vehicle to run smoothly,</b>

36
00:02:26.083 --> 00:02:28.000
<b>it is necessary</b>

37
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.083
<b>that all its wheels keep moving </b>
<b>at the same speed,</b>

38
00:02:32.083 --> 00:02:35.250
<b>keep moving in one direction.</b>

39
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:40.583
<b>For the vehicle to progress, this </b>
<b>coordination is extremely important.</b>

40
00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:43.208
<b>Now on the contrary,</b>

41
00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:46.000
<b>if one wheel of the vehicle stops,</b>

42
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.000
<b>or changes direction,</b>

43
00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.666
<b>then the entire vehicle will stop,</b>

44
00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:54.000
<b>will go awry.</b>

45
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.208
<b>Similarly,</b>

46
00:02:56.208 --> 00:03:00.666
<b>to run life smoothly, it is necessary</b>

47
00:03:00.666 --> 00:03:06.750
<b>that a person's thoughts and his </b>
<b>actions both remain progressive, </b>

48
00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:09.375
<b>move in one direction.</b>

49
00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:14.375
<b>Only then will a person progress </b>
<b>and life will be pleasant.</b>

50
00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:15.833
<b>But,</b>

51
00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:22.041
<b>if any of the thoughts and </b>
<b>actions become corrupted,</b>

52
00:03:22.041 --> 00:03:25.541
<b>then progress will stop right there.</b>

53
00:03:25.541 --> 00:03:27.541
<b>Life will be miserable.</b>

54
00:03:27.541 --> 00:03:30.083
<b>Some people, denying this truth,</b>

55
00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:34.083
<b>try to live life with the support of lies.</b>

56
00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:36.125
<b>They keep the mind dirty,</b>

57
00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:37.958
<b>do not improve it,</b>

58
00:03:37.958 --> 00:03:44.083
<b>but go on creating a clean </b>
<b>and false image in the world.</b>

59
00:03:44.083 --> 00:03:51.708
<b>This vehicle runs for some distance, </b>
<b>but with time their hypocrisy is exposed.</b>

60
00:03:51.708 --> 00:03:52.875
<b>And in such a situation,</b>

61
00:03:52.875 --> 00:04:01.208
<b>they lose their reputation, people's trust, </b>
<b>their respect, everything.</b>

62
00:04:01.208 --> 00:04:04.750
<b>People call such a person a pretender</b>

63
00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:08.916
<b>and stay away from him.</b>

64
00:04:08.916 --> 00:04:13.875
<b>People may talk outwardly</b>
<b>perhaps due to sociability,</b>

65
00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:16.833
<b>but behind the back they only speak ill.</b>

66
00:04:16.833 --> 00:04:18.375
<b>Ultimately</b>

67
00:04:18.375 --> 00:04:21.625
<b>such a person is left alone.</b>

68
00:04:21.625 --> 00:04:23.916
<b>He may deny as much as he wants,</b>

69
00:04:23.916 --> 00:04:29.458
<b>but this life of lies is making </b>
<b>him hollow from within.</b>

70
00:04:29.458 --> 00:04:32.208
<b>And a time will come</b>

71
00:04:32.208 --> 00:04:37.250
<b>when that person will also fall in his own eyes,</b>

72
00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.125
<b>will lose self-respect.</b>

73
00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:42.541
<b>Avoid such a situation.</b>

74
00:04:42.541 --> 00:04:44.958
<b>Not only the worldly image,</b>

75
00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:48.583
<b>keep the mind equally clean as well.</b>

76
00:04:48.583 --> 00:04:52.458
<b>The coordination of these two is necessary.</b>

77
00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.625
<b>In the society you live in,</b>

78
00:04:59.625 --> 00:05:02.666
<b>there are many such people,</b>

79
00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:05.583
<b>who say something outwardly,</b>

80
00:05:05.583 --> 00:05:12.708
<b>but internally harbor completely </b>
<b>opposite feelings.</b>

81
00:05:12.708 --> 00:05:15.500
<b>Honey drips from the mouth,</b>

82
00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.583
<b>but the mind is filled with bitterness.</b>

83
00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:22.000
<b>They talk like well-wishers,</b>

84
00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.291
<b>but there is a desire for harm in the mind.</b>

85
00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:30.791
<b>Will this pretense last for long?</b>

86
00:05:30.791 --> 00:05:32.916
<b>No.</b>

87
00:05:32.916 --> 00:05:36.125
<b>No one is so foolish</b>

88
00:05:36.125 --> 00:05:42.250
<b>that he can never understand the difference </b>
<b>between someone's words and deeds.</b>

89
00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:48.458
<b>One day or the other, </b>
<b>the true face comes to the fore.</b>

90
00:05:48.458 --> 00:05:52.458
<b>And then one has to face shame.</b>

91
00:05:52.458 --> 00:05:55.166
<b>Let’s introspect</b>

92
00:05:55.166 --> 00:06:02.541
<b>- do you not see signs of </b>
<b>such behavior in yourself as well?</b>

93
00:06:02.541 --> 00:06:04.416
<b>If you see,</b>

94
00:06:04.416 --> 00:06:06.625
<b>change it immediately.</b>

95
00:06:06.625 --> 00:06:08.916
<b>And the sad thing is also</b>

96
00:06:08.916 --> 00:06:15.541
<b>that many times the elders in the</b>
<b>family consider this behavior so normal</b>

97
00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:22.125
<b>that they praise someone on the face and </b>
<b>criticize behind the back in front of the children.</b>

98
00:06:22.125 --> 00:06:27.791
<b>They also do not think that </b>
<b>children's minds are impressionable.</b>

99
00:06:27.791 --> 00:06:32.666
<b>They learn by watching their elders, </b>
<b>they imitate.</b>

100
00:06:32.666 --> 00:06:37.541
<b>And this behavior is by no</b>
<b>means worthy of imitation.</b>

101
00:06:37.541 --> 00:06:39.833
<b>For the purification of oneself,</b>

102
00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:45.333
<b>and also to become an </b>
<b>excellent example for children.</b>

103
00:06:45.333 --> 00:06:49.041
<b>Do not get entangled in any such behavior.</b>

104
00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:51.708
<b>Keep the words clean,</b>

105
00:06:51.708 --> 00:06:54.750
<b>also purify the mind.</b>

106
00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:04.708
<b>In professional life, mutual </b>
<b>trust is extremely important.</b>

107
00:07:04.708 --> 00:07:08.833
<b>But have you ever thought?</b>

108
00:07:08.833 --> 00:07:14.166
<b>When does trust arise between two people?</b>

109
00:07:14.166 --> 00:07:16.125
<b>This happens</b>

110
00:07:16.125 --> 00:07:20.166
<b>when someone's words and </b>
<b>behavior are both the same.</b>

111
00:07:20.166 --> 00:07:22.125
<b>You tell me,</b>

112
00:07:22.125 --> 00:07:24.750
<b>who will you trust?</b>

113
00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.875
<b>One who says something and </b>
<b>does something else?</b>

114
00:07:27.875 --> 00:07:29.958
<b>Or someone who,</b>

115
00:07:29.958 --> 00:07:32.250
<b>if he has taken any responsibility,</b>

116
00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.291
<b>has given any assurance,</b>

117
00:07:34.291 --> 00:07:36.375
<b>will also fulfill it?</b>

118
00:07:36.375 --> 00:07:38.083
<b>In professional life,</b>

119
00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:41.708
<b>everyone's work depends on each other.</b>

120
00:07:41.708 --> 00:07:42.791
<b>In such a situation,</b>

121
00:07:42.791 --> 00:07:46.458
<b>important responsibilities are given to the person</b>

122
00:07:46.458 --> 00:07:49.708
<b>who is trustworthy.</b>

123
00:07:49.708 --> 00:07:50.708
<b>With the help of lies,</b>

124
00:07:50.708 --> 00:07:51.791
<b>flattery</b>

125
00:07:51.791 --> 00:07:57.000
<b>and professional politics, a person </b>
<b>can definitely achieve momentary progress.</b>

126
00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.083
<b>But</b>

127
00:07:58.083 --> 00:08:00.875
<b>the fulfillment of any big responsibility</b>

128
00:08:00.875 --> 00:08:05.250
<b>cannot happen by relying on these.</b>

129
00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:09.958
<b>The truth of such a person is exposed later on.</b>

130
00:08:09.958 --> 00:08:11.708
<b>And ultimately</b>

131
00:08:11.708 --> 00:08:14.708
<b>- not only is there professional loss,</b>

132
00:08:14.708 --> 00:08:21.791
<b>but the mind also remains impure </b>
<b>and dissatisfied due to such behavior.</b>

133
00:08:21.791 --> 00:08:25.416
<b>Don't run after momentary progress.</b>

134
00:08:25.416 --> 00:08:30.166
<b>True progress is only that which lasts long</b>

135
00:08:30.166 --> 00:08:31.166
<b>and</b>

136
00:08:31.166 --> 00:08:33.416
<b>also keeps the mind satisfied.</b>

